---
layout: base.njk
title: Articles | The Web3 Family
description: Notes from Christopher Clarke on starting a nonprofit and handling the technology side of it.
---
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Articles</h1>
    {% if collections.articles.length %}
    <div class="article-list">
      {% for article in collections.articles %}
      <div class="article-list-item">
        <p class="article-date">{{ article.date | readableDate }}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ article.data.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p>Nothing published yet. Check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
